= Guido Picelli

Picelli is a founding member of the <span style=" color:#c2352b">Red Guards</span> and a fierce anti-<span style="color:#3D3D3D;">reactionary</span>, having served in the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#008C45">It</span><span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CFCFCF">al</span><span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CD212A">ian</span> <span style=" color:#ED1C24">Red Cross</span> during the Great War. He is not affiliated with any factions of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span>.

